{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_121_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_121","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，衞侯使孫良夫來盟。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_121_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_121","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會齊侯伐萊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_121_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_121","textTraditional":"三、秋，公至自伐萊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_121_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_121","textTraditional":"四、大旱。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_121_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_121","textTraditional":"五、冬，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯于黑壤。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}